Summary:
Today was focused on self-learning activities for the internship, where I revised important React concepts to strengthen my frontend knowledge. I reviewed core ideas such as component structure, state, props, and basic hooks to improve clarity. This independent study was done to prepare for upcoming backend topics and frontend–backend integration. The work helped in reinforcing previously learned concepts.

Outcomes:
By the end of the day, I improved my understanding and confidence in React fundamentals. I was able to identify areas that need more practice before moving to advanced concepts. The self-learning process enhanced my ability to study independently and revise efficiently. Overall, this activity prepared me for future full stack development tasks.
